{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2016-05", "window": 3, "start_date": 1463356800, "end_date": 1464047999, "month_true_total": 137, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:11:34 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "23150070", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001414588", "personaname": "Techno", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/technojerk36/", "num_games_owned": 733, "num_reviews": 100, "playtime_forever": 2159, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1202, "last_played": 1554921109, "avatar": "42b7d8e2a9fdf193adb168f38911c8a4a2ef8204"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm normally not a fan of these sorts of games as your runs can depend entirely on how lucky you are with drops. Risk of Rain solves this problem by allowing you to pick what loot you get out of each chest. This really turned this game from another rouge-like into a game where you can plan your builds and where strategy matters.\n\nCombine that with an excellent astethic, a beautiful soundtrack and online/local co-op and I cannot recommend this game enough, even if you normally aren't a fan of rouge-like action platformers.", "timestamp_created": 1463973964, "timestamp_updated": 1463973964, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.546436309814453125", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "23149498", "author": {"steamid": "76561197961168771", "personaname": "Thunder Dumper", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197961168771/", "num_games_owned": 340, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 9702, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7914, "last_played": 1493877594, "avatar": "105cced2631283b6f0597685db5d15e18110f6f3"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you do not own this game, you are wrong.", "timestamp_created": 1463970439, "timestamp_updated": 1463970439, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "23140983", "author": {"steamid": "76561198143052345", "personaname": "Novel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheSovereignofDawn/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 1493, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1161, "last_played": 1555277829, "avatar": "d221759b0770f65b2da682dd3ed5772a76f21f6a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Incredibly innovative and beautiful game.  I love indie games as they provide a difference from the FPS games made by larger companies or teams.  This game is good at what it is.  It has everything a platformer ever needed.  I've unlocked almost every single thing in the game and it's just as fun as it was a year or two ago.  It offers any indie gamers alike would need.  Whoever lacks this game in their library doesn't deserve to live :). Thanks for your time.", "timestamp_created": 1463935030, "timestamp_updated": 1463935030, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525862038135528564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "23140063", "author": {"steamid": "76561198110101023", "personaname": "nano", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198110101023/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever"